<parameter=command>grep -rn "utf8_out" /workspace/repo-vul/src-vul/espeak-ng/src/libespeak-ng/*.c /workspace/repo-vul/src-vul/espeak-ng/src/libespeak-ng/*.h | head -20</｜｜DSML｜｜>

